@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
title Vulnerable web demo — startup and evidence lifecycle

start
:Spring prepares Environment;
:Resolve mazewall.enabled once;
:Publish resolved-enabled decision;
:Reject simultaneous enforcement + profiling;
if (Protection enabled?) then (yes)
  :Require mounted profile + complete collector evidence;
  :Install process-wide NO_EXEC baseline;
  :Create contained service executors;
else (no)
  if (Profile mode?) then (yes)
    :Create profiling service executors;
  else (no)
    :Create deliberately unprotected services;
  endif
endif
:Accept service work;
:Spring shutdown begins;
:Stop admission;
:Drain all accepted work to one deadline;
if (Profile mode?) then (yes)
  :Close profiler sessions;
  :Freeze behavior + per-collector coverage;
  :Complete only if drain AND every collector complete;
  :Write immutable SBoB generation;
  :Write immutable stack dictionary generation;
  :Write digest-backed integrity record;
  :Atomically replace current-generation pointer;
endif
stop
note right
Default artifact excludes executable gadget fixtures.
Explicit isolated fixture artifact/profile opts in.
Shared profile-artifacts volume:
profiling RW / enforcement RO.
Container bind 0.0.0.0; published host ports 127.0.0.1.
end note
@enduml
